      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RESTLESS SPIRIT (8) finally comes up with a better draw and strips fitter third up. Found a fairly strong C1 when closing late to secure fourth last over 1400m at Goulburn. Can settle much closer today and gets in light with Cole's claim. Go close. NIKITA ZOU (7) holding form and can go on with it now. Tracked the speed and boxed on steadily to get off the mark in a Wagga Maiden. Will go back from the draw and be ridden for luck. DUBAI ADVENTURE (1) hard fit heading into this and finds an easier assignment. Chipped away late when sixth over 1200m at Kembla Grange. No excuses today at the each way price. REVOKE (10) resumes with a good fresh record and finally comes up with a good gate. Snagged back at her last two outings in stronger races. Keep safe with the claim.",
